@startuml
title Paid order exchange - quote, approval and credit
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
actor Customer
participant "Menu / exchange cart" as UI
participant "NestJS API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
actor Barista
Customer -> UI: Select replacement items, size and toppings
UI -> API: Quote(orderId, items)
API --> UI: Server total, credit, delta and fingerprint
Customer -> UI: Confirm quote and reason
UI -> API: Request(key, items, expectedQuote)
API -> DB: Lock source Order; store REQUESTED + quote
note right of DB: Source remains paid/reserved
note right of DB: REQUESTED blocks preparation
Barista -> API: Decide(id, version, approve, note)
API -> DB: Begin; lock source Order, recheck state/version
alt Reject or customer withdraws before decision
 API -> DB: Update request state/version; keep source order
else Approve while source is PAID
 API -> DB: Lock union of old/new ingredients in ID order
 API -> DB: Release old snapshot; reserve new selection
 API -> DB: Create replacement + credit; cancel source
 API -> DB: APPROVED + replacement link + version increment
 note right of DB: Any failure rolls back all changes
end
API -> DB: Commit
API --> UI: Refresh order/request state
alt Delta = 0
 UI --> Customer: Replacement already PAID
else Delta > 0
 UI -> API: VNPay payment for delta only
 API --> UI: Payment URL / QR
end
@enduml
